{"symbol":"DFPL","yahoo":"DFPL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Dindigul Farm Product Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","website":"https://ennutrica.com","about":"Dindigul Farm Product Limited engages in the processing, manufacturing, and sale of milk products in India. The company offers skimmed and whole milk powder, dairy whitener, whey powder, BakeTex+, milk whey powder, acid casein, sodium casenate, and evaporated milk; and IceTex and DairyTex products.It also provides milk products for new age nutrition, protein fortification, and taste and texture enhancing, as well as fast release nutrition applications. In addition, the company offers various services, such as food designing, formulations, and necessary technical assistance. It serves nutrition and pharma, dairy, chocolates, baked foods, food ingredients, ice cream, and paper/leather/industrial product industries. Dindigul Farm Product Limited was incorporated in 2010 and is based in Dindigul, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:18:21+00:00","quote":{"price":27.07,"prevClose":28.49,"marketCap":66.13,"high52":29.8,"low52":9.91,"pe":17.69,"bookValue":15.94,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":10.03,"shares":2.4429,"insiders":61.11,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-06-27","2024-06-28","2024-07-01","2024-07-02","2024-07-03","2024-07-04","2024-07-05","2024-07-08","2024-07-09","2024-07-10","2024-07-11","2024-07-12","2024-07-15","2024-07-16","2024-07-18","2024-07-19","2024-07-22","2024-07-23","2024-07-24","2024-07-25","2024-07-26","2024-07-29","2024-07-30","2024-07-31","2024-08-01","2024-08-02","2024-08-05","2024-08-06","2024-08-07","2024-08-08","2024-08-09","2024-08-12","2024-08-13","2024-08-14","2024-08-16","2024-08-19","2024-08-20","2024-08-21","2024-08-22","2024-08-23","2024-08-26","2024-08-27","2024-08-28","2024-08-29","2024-08-30","2024-09-02","2024-09-03","2024-09-04","2024-09-05","2024-09-06","2024-09-09","2024-09-10","2024-09-11","2024-09-12","2024-09-13","2024-09-16","2024-